(6047929, 889865, 65234, '<td valign="top">Heh; that looks sadly familiar.  But I''m afraid to get new stuff for the animals to chew on ;-)<br/> <br/>B&amp;W works well.</td>', 'Heh; that looks sadly familiar.  But I''m afraid to get new stuff for the animals to chew on ;-) B&W works well.', '2010-06-09 08:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047930, 889309, 29079, '<td valign="top">very clever set up</td>', 'very clever set up', '2010-06-09 08:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047932, 889729, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice light.  Ordinarily I prefer to see more of the subjects'' faces but the body language here is very emotive.</td>', 'Nice light.  Ordinarily I prefer to see more of the subjects'' faces but the body language here is very emotive.', '2010-06-09 08:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047933, 889393, 14867, '<td valign="top">Really cool. <br/>The colors, obviously, but also the different scales are making the image particularly interesting - and even funny.<br/>Would get a 10 (and a fav) from me if you had cropped the window on right side - distracting for the eye.<br/>Still a 9</td>', 'Really cool. The colors, obviously, but also the different scales are making the image particularly interesting - and even funny.Would get a 10 (and a fav) from me if you had cropped the window on right side - distracting for the eye.Still a 9', '2010-06-09 08:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047936, 889691, 65234, '<td valign="top">Oh, how adorable!  Love the tassels on the trikes and that the kids are color-coordinated with the trikes to stand out from the cool greens of the woods.</td>', 'Oh, how adorable!  Love the tassels on the trikes and that the kids are color-coordinated with the trikes to stand out from the cool greens of the woods.', '2010-06-09 08:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047938, 889629, 14867, '<td valign="top">Nice.<br/>Not sure about the background... at first sight, its texture above looked like digital noise...:)</td>', 'Nice.Not sure about the background... at first sight, its texture above looked like digital noise...:)', '2010-06-09 08:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047939, 888078, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looking like they want to make even more baby Starlings ;-)  Great detail and certainly an interesting pose.  Looks like it could use a little contrast boost or darkening on the midtones and shadows.  Just a little.  Really a wonderful image.</td>', 'Looking like they want to make even more baby Starlings ;-)  Great detail and certainly an interesting pose.  Looks like it could use a little contrast boost or darkening on the midtones and shadows.  Just a little.  Really a wonderful image.', '2010-06-09 08:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047942, 889523, 14867, '<td valign="top">amazing synchronization!</td>', 'amazing synchronization!', '2010-06-09 08:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047945, 889828, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very cool image!  Love the composition with the rainbows and birds.  Sky looks very oversaturated on my screen; I''d definitely tone down the cyans, although in Basic you might lose some of the rainbows that way.  So maybe just crop out the sky.</td>', 'Very cool image!  Love the composition with the rainbows and birds.  Sky looks very oversaturated on my screen; I''d definitely tone down the cyans, although in Basic you might lose some of the rainbows that way.  So maybe just crop out the sky.', '2010-06-09 08:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047946, 889608, 29079, '<td valign="top">what an adorable little girl!</td>', 'what an adorable little girl!', '2010-06-09 08:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047947, 889453, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice fidn for this challenge.</td>', 'Nice fidn for this challenge.', '2010-06-09 08:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047948, 889866, 29079, '<td valign="top">love the effect</td>', 'love the effect', '2010-06-09 08:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047949, 889763, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great light; processing looks a little cartoony to me.</td>', 'Great light; processing looks a little cartoony to me.', '2010-06-09 08:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047950, 888843, 65234, '<td valign="top">Pretty colors.  Focus seems sharpest on the buds in the foreground; if the subject is meant to be two stems/clusters or some such I''d prefer at least one of them be in sharp focus.</td>', 'Pretty colors.  Focus seems sharpest on the buds in the foreground; if the subject is meant to be two stems/clusters or some such I''d prefer at least one of them be in sharp focus.', '2010-06-09 08:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047952, 889873, 65234, '<td valign="top">Not really a fan of the processing.  Psrticularly for this challenge I''d like to be able to clearly see that there are two subjects and have some better detail on at least one of them.</td>', 'Not really a fan of the processing.  Psrticularly for this challenge I''d like to be able to clearly see that there are two subjects and have some better detail on at least one of them.', '2010-06-09 08:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047953, 889313, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very pretty floral shot.</td>', 'Very pretty floral shot.', '2010-06-09 08:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047954, 889284, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect.</td>', 'Interesting effect.', '2010-06-09 08:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047955, 889848, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely birds.  Hanging out in a busy background but they probably don''t take direction well ;-)</td>', 'Lovely birds.  Hanging out in a busy background but they probably don''t take direction well ;-)', '2010-06-09 08:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047956, 889871, 118409, '<td valign="top">really cool! Hpw did you do it?? Is it two different people!????</td>', 'really cool! Hpw did you do it?? Is it two different people!????', '2010-06-09 08:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047959, 889715, 65234, '<td valign="top">More hoverflies will be joining the world shortly ;-)  Nice detail on this pair.</td>', 'More hoverflies will be joining the world shortly ;-)  Nice detail on this pair.', '2010-06-09 08:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047960, 889658, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like the backlighting.</td>', 'Like the backlighting.', '2010-06-09 08:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047961, 889473, 65234, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous little bird!  Love the soft greens of the water, too.</td>', 'Gorgeous little bird!  Love the soft greens of the water, too.', '2010-06-09 08:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047963, 889418, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely light and composition that really shows off the delicacy of the Bleeding Heart plant.</td>', 'Lovely light and composition that really shows off the delicacy of the Bleeding Heart plant.', '2010-06-09 08:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047964, 889677, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very cute barn cats.  Light is nice and I like that I can so clearly see they''re in a barn.</td>', 'Very cute barn cats.  Light is nice and I like that I can so clearly see they''re in a barn.', '2010-06-09 08:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047968, 889688, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of subject.  Not a fan of the processing shadows all around the lilies.</td>', 'Nice choice of subject.  Not a fan of the processing shadows all around the lilies.', '2010-06-09 08:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047970, 889591, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great pose!!!  Beautiful detail and bokeh.</td>', 'Great pose!!!  Beautiful detail and bokeh.', '2010-06-09 08:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047975, 889598, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice macro.  Background colors bring out the hiints of orange in the butterflies'' wings nicely.</td>', 'Very nice macro.  Background colors bring out the hiints of orange in the butterflies'' wings nicely.', '2010-06-09 08:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047978, 888853, 65234, '<td valign="top">Texture on the pods is really interesting.  Light looks very harsh to my eye.</td>', 'Texture on the pods is really interesting.  Light looks very harsh to my eye.', '2010-06-09 08:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047983, 889608, 65234, '<td valign="top">They are lovely eyes.  I think for this challenge I''d prefer that just the eyes be in focus, or the crop tighter, or something to make the eyes clearly the subject of the shot and not the whole face, cute though it is.</td>', 'They are lovely eyes.  I think for this challenge I''d prefer that just the eyes be in focus, or the crop tighter, or something to make the eyes clearly the subject of the shot and not the whole face, cute though it is.', '2010-06-09 08:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047986, 889850, 65234, '<td valign="top">:-)  Very creative take on the challenge.</td>', ':-)  Very creative take on the challenge.', '2010-06-09 08:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047987, 889593, 65234, '<td valign="top">Think I might prefer a more unusual perspective for this.  Also looks to be a big soft in focus.</td>', 'Think I might prefer a more unusual perspective for this.  Also looks to be a big soft in focus.', '2010-06-09 08:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047988, 889808, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love the background!  Really makes this shot stand out from the stereotypical wineglass image.</td>', 'Love the background!  Really makes this shot stand out from the stereotypical wineglass image.', '2010-06-09 09:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047991, 888027, 118409, '<td valign="top">Mmmmmmmmmmmmmmm, Breakfast!!!</td>', 'Mmmmmmmmmmmmmmm, Breakfast!!!', '2010-06-09 09:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047992, 887804, 101668, '<td valign="top">I am a sucker for Arums. These are great and fit the challenge well</td>', 'I am a sucker for Arums. These are great and fit the challenge well', '2010-06-09 09:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047994, 889851, 65234, '<td valign="top">They look like they''ve been gilt!</td>', 'They look like they''ve been gilt!', '2010-06-09 09:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047995, 889686, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition; would like the closer Monarch to be in sharper focus.</td>', 'Lovely composition; would like the closer Monarch to be in sharper focus.', '2010-06-09 09:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047999, 889393, 65234, '<td valign="top">One for grownups and one for kids?!  Feels very off-kilter, though perhaps you meant it to.</td>', 'One for grownups and one for kids?!  Feels very off-kilter, though perhaps you meant it to.', '2010-06-09 09:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6048009, 889651, 65234, '<td valign="top">This just cries out for a cartoon dialog balloon for that top bird LOL!  Great detail and DOF; very fun image.</td>', 'This just cries out for a cartoon dialog balloon for that top bird LOL!  Great detail and DOF; very fun image.', '2010-06-09 09:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6048012, 889435, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great capture!</td>', 'Great capture!', '2010-06-09 09:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6048060, 889373, 103142, '<td valign="top">absolutely wonderful photo -- but your subjects really aren''t similar... sorry -5-</td>', 'absolutely wonderful photo -- but your subjects really aren''t similar... sorry -5-', '2010-06-09 09:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6048062, 889717, 17507, '<td valign="top">Excellent choice of subject for a study in minimalism. However, you''ll have to control the reflections for a shot like this to work. Also, the placement of the large vase so far to the left creates a somewhat unbalanced image, as well as tension with the too-close edge of the frame. The black border seems unnecessarily stark--your photo is fairly high key, so the black stands out in sharp contrast and tends to draw the eye away from your subjects. (6)</td>', 'Excellent choice of subject for a study in minimalism. However, you''ll have to control the reflections for a shot like this to work. Also, the placement of the large vase so far to the left creates a somewhat unbalanced image, as well as tension with the too-close edge of the frame. The black border seems unnecessarily stark--your photo is fairly high key, so the black stands out in sharp contrast and tends to draw the eye away from your subjects. (6)', '2010-06-09 09:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6048064, 889533, 17507, '<td valign="top">Wow. What an exceptionally unphotogenic subject. One typically does not associate slimy water-dwellers with the concept of motherhood.</td>', 'Wow. What an exceptionally unphotogenic subject. One typically does not associate slimy water-dwellers with the concept of motherhood.', '2010-06-09 09:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6048070, 889421, 101668, '<td valign="top">Excellent!</td>', 'Excellent!', '2010-06-09 10:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
