(6048595, 889255, 83313, '<td valign="top">Some great subjects with a lot of potential, but I feel this shot is rather plain. Standing them next to each other and shooting from the fron, perhaps from a low perspective, might lend the subjects a lot more visual impact.</td>', 'Some great subjects with a lot of potential, but I feel this shot is rather plain. Standing them next to each other and shooting from the fron, perhaps from a low perspective, might lend the subjects a lot more visual impact.', '2010-06-09 14:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6048605, 888106, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, the subject is interesting, and it is shot from a great low perspective. I think, however, that it could benefit from cranking up the colors and contrast a little more. Certainly worth a vote on the positive side of the scale.</td>', 'I like this shot, the subject is interesting, and it is shot from a great low perspective. I think, however, that it could benefit from cranking up the colors and contrast a little more. Certainly worth a vote on the positive side of the scale.', '2010-06-09 14:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
