(6058231, 889566, 30861, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mpeters:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats Robert. You do realize that two skiff entries in a row(both of which finished highly) will start to erode your reputation... ;) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Counting my current entry in "Boats". 4 of my last 6 entries have had boats in ''em. It''s that time of year, don''tcha know?<br/> <br/>At least these skiffs aren''t my usual skiffs on the Herring River, like the HDR pair; these are down-cape 12 miles or so at Hemenway Landing on Nauset Marsh, Eastham. Same location as "Unbearable Lightness of Being" and "Beached Skiff", actually...</td>', 'Originally posted by mpeters: Congrats Robert. You do realize that two skiff entries in a row(both of which finished highly) will start to erode your reputation... ;)   Counting my current entry in "Boats". 4 of my last 6 entries have had boats in ''em. It''s that time of year, don''tcha know? At least these skiffs aren''t my usual skiffs on the Herring River, like the HDR pair; these are down-cape 12 miles or so at Hemenway Landing on Nauset Marsh, Eastham. Same location as "Unbearable Lightness of Being" and "Beached Skiff", actually...', '2010-06-16 01:58:49.000000', NULL, 0),
