(6058838, 889874, 2553, '<td valign="top">Well friend, you definitely got "dpc''ed" on this one.  I like it, very nice and abstract, but you can clearly see that the two black boxes are in perfectly sharp focus and I can clearly see the "rat" on the left in the shot, the one on the right not so clearly.  Great bokeh.  Sorry to see you way down here!</td>', 'Well friend, you definitely got "dpc''ed" on this one.  I like it, very nice and abstract, but you can clearly see that the two black boxes are in perfectly sharp focus and I can clearly see the "rat" on the left in the shot, the one on the right not so clearly.  Great bokeh.  Sorry to see you way down here!', '2010-06-16 09:52:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(6058853, 887875, 21304, '<td valign="top">cool shot<br/> <br/>out of curiosity, have you figured out under what situations the 10-20 creates hotspots (like the bottom left hand side of your shot) in infrared and under what circumstances it doesn''t? I''ve tried this lens for IR several times and have had very different results depending on the situation - but I''m yet to figure it all out!</td>', 'cool shot out of curiosity, have you figured out under what situations the 10-20 creates hotspots (like the bottom left hand side of your shot) in infrared and under what circumstances it doesn''t? I''ve tried this lens for IR several times and have had very different results depending on the situation - but I''m yet to figure it all out!', '2010-06-16 09:58:27.000000', NULL, 0),
