(6059093, 889538, 30214, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by pawdrix:</b></div><hr/><i> "Now, having said that, I still don''t understand why my entry scored so low, after all it squarely meets the challenge..."<br/> <br/>Peoples backs, without much of a side story. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>well, to me it has quite a bit of a story, or a commentary on human relationships... their backs do say a lot. look at his confident posture and the way he rests his heavy hands on their shoulders... look at their tentative and non-obtrusive hands hugging his torso but not touching each other... he is probably an older guy (look at his balding head) and sort of a "mentor" for these two younger girls who are best friends from high school and cannot quite decide among themselveswho gets this guy. Or they wait for him to decide but he is quite content with the current arrangement :). I may be imagining things but it does not really matter as long as the image allows me to imagine things...</td>', 'Originally posted by pawdrix: "Now, having said that, I still don''t understand why my entry scored so low, after all it squarely meets the challenge..." Peoples backs, without much of a side story.  well, to me it has quite a bit of a story, or a commentary on human relationships... their backs do say a lot. look at his confident posture and the way he rests his heavy hands on their shoulders... look at their tentative and non-obtrusive hands hugging his torso but not touching each other... he is probably an older guy (look at his balding head) and sort of a "mentor" for these two younger girls who are best friends from high school and cannot quite decide among themselveswho gets this guy. Or they wait for him to decide but he is quite content with the current arrangement :). I may be imagining things but it does not really matter as long as the image allows me to imagine things...', '2010-06-16 12:48:26.000000', NULL, 0),
