(6060751, 888252, 82112, '<td valign="top">Mary,<br/> <br/>I find that photos like this do okay on DPC, but never score as high as I would like to see them. I REALLY LIKE THIS! I think smallish flowers with limited DOF can have great POP to them, and you have certainly done this pair justice. Border treatment is tops as well.<br/> <br/>Keep up the good work!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Mary, I find that photos like this do okay on DPC, but never score as high as I would like to see them. I REALLY LIKE THIS! I think smallish flowers with limited DOF can have great POP to them, and you have certainly done this pair justice. Border treatment is tops as well. Keep up the good work! ', '2010-06-17 08:17:24.000000', NULL, 0),
