(6060914, 889563, 68947, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the score, Steve! Of course, I thought that this should have ribboned. :)  <br/> <br/>There''s NOTHING wrong with the composition!  It''s wonderful as is!  I think that''s what grabbed a lot of higher scores.  Look at the 7''s, 8''s, 9''s and 10''s that you got! :) It''s a tremendous shot and well done...in spite of some of the challenges that you say you faced in the smoothing of the sky.  I think you did a wonderful job on it and I love it! :)  Going to fave it now :)</td>', 'Congrats on the score, Steve! Of course, I thought that this should have ribboned. :)   There''s NOTHING wrong with the composition!  It''s wonderful as is!  I think that''s what grabbed a lot of higher scores.  Look at the 7''s, 8''s, 9''s and 10''s that you got! :) It''s a tremendous shot and well done...in spite of some of the challenges that you say you faced in the smoothing of the sky.  I think you did a wonderful job on it and I love it! :)  Going to fave it now :)', '2010-06-17 13:15:02.000000', NULL, 0),
