(6067187, 889328, 118194, '<td valign="top">I am really happy that at least some people liked it. It was a really quick \''session\'' and the beetoot soup could not wait :) I have uploaded two more photos here: www.flickr.c o m/photos/bartek-grygiel/sets/72157624156504507<br/>Two people mentioned that the door and the bag bothers them, or that it even ruins the photo. I did try the crop but it took one dimesion away. I know may people like when the subject pops at them. I actually prefer pictures forcing my eyes to roll a bit and figure out what the environment of the subject was. Anyway. Here is the cropped version [rejected:)]:<br/>www.flickr.c o m/photos/bartek-grygiel/4726912116<br/> <br/></td>', 'I am really happy that at least some people liked it. It was a really quick \''session\'' and the beetoot soup could not wait :) I have uploaded two more photos here: www.flickr.c o m/photos/bartek-grygiel/sets/72157624156504507Two people mentioned that the door and the bag bothers them, or that it even ruins the photo. I did try the crop but it took one dimesion away. I know may people like when the subject pops at them. I actually prefer pictures forcing my eyes to roll a bit and figure out what the environment of the subject was. Anyway. Here is the cropped version [rejected:)]:www.flickr.c o m/photos/bartek-grygiel/4726912116 ', '2010-06-23 03:41:36.000000', NULL, 0),
