(6261026, 889764, 83544, '<td valign="top">lol someone had trouble leaving you a comment :D, so I''ll be the first one. I''ll like how the planes are synchronized, almost looking like you''ve just cloned one :), the light blue sky really ads to the dark blue color of the planes. Perfectly composed.</td>', 'lol someone had trouble leaving you a comment :D, so I''ll be the first one. I''ll like how the planes are synchronized, almost looking like you''ve just cloned one :), the light blue sky really ads to the dark blue color of the planes. Perfectly composed.', '2010-12-24 21:25:27.000000', NULL, 0),
